Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Conclusion for Exercise 12.9",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\nEven correcting the factor of ten thousand exaggeration of the question, \
the final result is still staggering. To perform an optimal, all-sky search \
for a single unknown pulsar in six months of data would require nearly 5 \
million (and not 50 billion) of the world\[CloseCurlyQuote]s fastest \
supercomputers.\nThis calculation powerfully illustrates why such \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]blind\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] searches are \
computationally impossible to perform optimally. Instead, researchers must \
use hierarchical methods and other clever algorithms to conduct sub-optimal \
searches, which trade some sensitivity for a computationally feasible \
problem. It also highlights the importance of targeted searches, where the \
sky position and frequency are already known from radio pulsar observations, \
dramatically reducing the number of required templates.\n\n"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.963173942051949*^9, 3.963173946655737*^9}, {
  3.9631739806786423`*^9, 3.9631740593965054`*^9}, {3.963174114693613*^9, 
  3.963174181847884*^9}},
 TextJustification->1.,ExpressionUUID->"1e4ecf25-aca7-4953-977f-184e6477b858"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Exercise 12.11(d)", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.963174690173608*^9, 
  3.963174696151276*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9395eaab-6678-4aca-a486-\
5fa2297f66d1"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "(d) In Schutz\[CloseCurlyQuote]s Table 12.1, look at the masses given for \
GW170817. The collaboration published uncertainty ranges for these values as \
well (abbott2019properties). The uncertainty in the chirp mass was one part \
in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox["10", "3"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$10^3$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e712e944-ffba-42fa-a453-e7cc1db31145"],
 ", so for the purposes of this exercise, we take it as exactly known. The \
90% uncertainty range of the total mass ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["M", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$M$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "eee50c68-c648-42bb-a661-3d9a2d72cadd"],
 " was asymmetrical, given as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"+0.04", ",", "-0.01"}], ")"}], " ", 
         SubscriptBox["M", "\[CircleDot]"]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$(+0.04, -0.01)\\,\\text{M}_\\odot$", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5dc1c4c6-09d8-46ba-9919-6fa5e79e19e7"],
 ". Calculate the corresponding 90% bounds on the component masses ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["m", "TI"], "1"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$m_1$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c8571c00-3a57-4c3c-ae39-50e8bf7d3df2"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["m", "TI"], "2"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$m_2$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bd06da0b-c28b-4634-a628-617c896768bf"],
 ". (These are only approximate bounds; a full analysis would take into \
account the uncertainty in the chirp mass and its correlation with the \
uncertainty in the total mass.)."
}], "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.963174763148039*^9, 3.963174893926682*^9}},
 TextJustification->1.,ExpressionUUID->"08817850-29b2-456d-9dac-eda47fc4f139"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "From", " ", "Table", " ", "12.1", " ", "in", " ", "the", " ", 
     "textbook"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"we", " ", "have", " ", "the", " ", "best"}], "-", 
     RowBox[{
     "fit", " ", "masses", " ", "for", " ", "the", " ", "two", " ", "\n", 
      "neutron", " ", "stars", " ", "in", " ", 
      RowBox[{"GW170817", "."}]}]}]}], "*)"}], "\n", "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"m1", " ", "=", " ", "1.44"}], ";"}], " ", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
    "Mass", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "primary", " ", "component", " ", 
     "in", " ", "solar", " ", "masses"}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
