Cell[TextData[{
 "Recall this was used in the derivation of the FRW metric in Schutz ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["13.2", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\textsection13.2", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "aaf48f03-99c6-4130-b1fd-d05b2d2c2430"],
 ". \nFor the geometry to be flat we require the Riemann tensor to be zero, \
see ,\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       Cell[
        BoxData[
         FormBox[
          GridBox[{{
             Cell[
              TextData[{" ", 
                Cell[
                 BoxData[
                  SubsuperscriptBox[
                   StyleBox["R", "TI"], "\[Beta]\[Mu]\[Nu]", "\[Alpha]"]], 
                 "InlineFormula"], " "}], CellTags -> "eqn:ex12.7.1"], 
             Cell[
              TextData[{" ", 
                Cell[
                 BoxData[
                  RowBox[{"\[LongEqual]", "0."}]], "InlineFormula"], " "}]], 
             Cell[
              TextData[{" ", 
                Cell["Schutz Eq.\[NonBreakingSpace](6.71)", "InlineFormula"], 
                " "}]]}}], TraditionalForm]]], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\begin{align}\\label{eqn:ex12.7.1}\nR^\\alpha_{\\sis \\beta \\mu \\nu} \
&= 0. & \\mbox{Schutz Eq.~(6.71)}\n\\end{align}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "53903aba-32f4-4131-97e8-dae793ef2e83"],
 "\nLowering and then raising the first index in Schutz Eq.(6.71) we easily \
confirm that\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       Cell[
        BoxData[
         FormBox[
          GridBox[{{
             Cell[
              TextData[{" ", 
                Cell[
                 BoxData[
                  RowBox[{
                    SubscriptBox[
                    StyleBox["R", "TI"], "\[Alpha]\[Beta]\[Mu]\[Nu]"], 
                    "\[LongEqual]", "0  ", "\[DoubleLongLeftRightArrow]  ", 
                    SubsuperscriptBox[
                    StyleBox["R", "TI"], "\[Beta]\[Mu]\[Nu]", "\[Alpha]"], 
                    "\[LongEqual]", "0", ","}]], "InlineFormula"], " "}]]}}], 
          TraditionalForm]]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\begin{align}\nR_{\\alpha \\beta \\mu \\nu} = 0 \\quad \
\\Longleftrightarrow \\quad R^\\alpha_{\\sis \\beta \\mu \\nu} = 0,\n\
\\end{align}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "701ac8e5-e75a-4b36-8ea5-791b521be183"],
 "\nwhich will simplify our calculations. \nWe calculated the Riemann tensor \
for the line element Schutz Eq. (13.8) in Exercise 13.6 above."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9635311742324142`*^9, 
  3.963531358805298*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"38897bad-1be2-46d3-9f22-\
4d39b9a1ccec"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\n", 
